    "detailed_description": "In this action game you play the role of Billy Blade who, with his best friend Kong the monkey, is searching for the legendary Temple of Time. When Billy finally finds the Temple of Time Kong accidentally gets trapped inside one of the time crystals that they were there to loot. It's now up to Billy to time travel in order to save his friend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Billy you'll have to travel to Ancient Persia, The Ice Age, and The Caribbean and hack and slash your way to the top in order to fight The Guardians of Time. Each level challenges the player with platform jumping as well as sword fighting and also simple puzzle solving. Each level also includes various power-ups for the player to use in their quest as well as treasures to collect.",
